<title>USA: Startronix faces temporary restraing order.</title>
<headline>Startronix faces temporary restraing order.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Startronix International Inc was hit with a temporary restraining order yesterday preventing it from issuing any common stock to parties other than plaintiffs locked in a lawsuit against the company, a spokesman for the plaintiffs said.</p>
<p>Startronix is the defendant in a suit in which plaintiffs are seeking stock the company had agreed to issue to them in private placements, the spokesman said.</p>
<p>The private placements were completed between June and October 1996, the spokesman said.</p>
<p>Officials from the company were not immediately available to comment.</p>
</text>
